# Bodies the program layer doesn't lower yet, one TAB-separated site per line: `program.trap`,
# the body's symbol, and why it isn't lowered. An `AVRA_PROGRAM=1` build of a package under this
# tree stands a trap in for each body it can't lower, and FAILS on one this file doesn't list.
# This file only ever SHRINKS: no build writes it; a fix deletes its line, and a human adds one
# only by review (CLAUDE.md's baseline law).
